    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d130">

                <pb facs="0216" n="114" sameAs="frus:frus1919v01/pg114"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">715.1715/71: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Nicaragua</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Jefferson</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Managua</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1918-09-24T14:00:00-05:45"><hi rendition="#italic">September 24,
                                1918, 2 p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[<hi rendition="#italic">Received 10.19
                            p.m.</hi>]</dateline></opener>
                <p>Department’s September 20, 5 p.m.<anchor n="23" xml:id="d130-f1"/> Nicaraguan
                    Government apparently is complying with its agreement and has no patrol in Las
                        <pb facs="0217" n="115" xml:id="pg115"/> Trojas. I shall continue to make it
                    clear to the President that his guards et cetera are not to proceed farther than
                    the zone occupied by them on May 20th, 1918.</p>
                <p>Honduran Chargé d’Affaires stated to me that he did not anticipate any further
                    difficulties. His relations with Chamorro<anchor n="24" xml:id="d130-f2"/> are
                    very cordial.</p>
                <p>I do not believe that there will be any further trouble here regarding this
                    matter. All is apparently progressing in a very satisfactory manner.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Jefferson</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d130-f1" n="23" xml:id="d130-f1-content">
                <p>Not printed.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d130-f2" n="24" xml:id="d130-f2-content">
                <p>Gen. Emiliano Chamorro, President of Nicaragua.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
